[?2004l# DFIR Investigation Progress & Working Checklist

## Timeline of Investigation
- **2026-08-11 03:20 UTC**: Incident intake logged for target `smb-prod-01` (`/sas/handoff/intake.pdf`). High-severity EDR alert cluster received.
- **Initial Alert Review**: Inspected `/sas/alerts.json`, `/sas/vulns.json`, `/sas/baseline.json`. Observed alerts for exploit implant (`/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe`), LSASS dump (`/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`), ransomware (`/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`), and SMBv1 baseline (`/disk/Windows/System32/drivers/srv.sys`).
- **Disk Artifact Analysis**: Conducted forensic evaluation of read-only image `/disk`. Discovered silent persistence mechanisms and anti-forensic activity omitted from SAS alerts:
  - Silent WMI event subscription (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`).
  - Silent DLL search-order hijacking via `/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`.
  - Anti-forensic System log clearing recorded in `/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx` (EventID 1102).
  - C2 beacon IP `198.51.100.218` and domain `update-smb.example.cn` recovered from `/disk/Windows/System32/config/RegBack/SECURITY.bak`.
- **Ticket Reconciliation**: Reconciled change ticket `/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md` against on-disk and CTI evidence.
- **Deliverable Generation**: Produced forensic reports, baseline analysis, vulnerability assessment, and remediation plan under `/app`.

## Checklist
- [x] Analyze alert and vulnerability feeds (`/sas/alerts.json`, `/sas/vulns.json`, `/sas/baseline.json`)
- [x] Review CTI Advisory & ATT&CK Mapping (`/sas/cti/advisory.txt`, `/sas/cti/advisory.pdf`)
- [x] Inspect `/disk` filesystem and evidence artifacts
- [x] Identify entry vector & exploit implant (`/disk/Windows/Temp/mssecsvc.exe`)
- [x] Identify credential dumping artifact (`/disk/Windows/Temp/lsass.dmp`)
- [x] Identify ransomware payload (`/disk/Users/Public/enc.exe`)
- [x] Uncover silent persistence mechanism 1: WMI Event Subscription (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/Repository/OBJECTS.DATA`)
- [x] Uncover silent persistence mechanism 2: DLL Hijacking (`/disk/Windows/System32/wbem/wbemcomn.dll`)
- [x] Uncover silent defense evasion: Event Log Clearing (`/disk/Windows/System32/winevt/Logs/System.evtx`)
- [x] Reconcile change ticket against evidence (`/sas/handoff/change-ticket.md`)
- [x] Compile all 5 required reports in `/app` with backtick citations
